{"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "query": "Unit tests for an Arduino Uno module: Pomodoro timer with TM1637 display, DS1307 statistics and a single button. Pins: pin 3 OUTPUT TM1637 CLK; pin 4 OUTPUT TM1637 DIO; pin 6 INPUT button (HIGH = pressed, external pull-down); pin 9 OUTPUT buzzer (tone); pin 18 I2C DS1307 SDA (A4); pin 19 I2C DS1307 SCL (A5). Arduino API used: attachInterrupt, delay, digitalRead, noTone, pinMode, sizeof, tone. Libraries: Rtc by Makuna, Grove 4-Digit Display, TimerOne. Library API used: Begin, Copyright, Day, DayOfWeek, GetDateTime, GetIsRunning, GetMemory, IsDateTimeValid, LastError, Minute, Month, RtcDateTime, Second, SetDateTime, SetIsRunning, SetMemory, SetSquareWavePin, Year, attachInterrupt, clearDisplay, countof, delay, digitalRead, display, displayNum, displayStr, for, init, initialize, pinMode, point, return, set, sizeof, switch, uint8_t. Simulated devices: wokwi-ds1307, wokwi-tm1637-7segment, wokwi-pushbutton, wokwi-buzzer. Functions to test: void pomo_set_delay_scale(uint8_t percent), void pomo_init(), void pomo_start_timer(), void pomo_tick(), void pomo_update(), void pomo_handle_action(uint8_t action), uint8_t pomo_read_click(), uint8_t pomo_status(), uint8_t pomo_prev_status(), int8_t pomo_minute(), int8_t pomo_second(), int8_t pomo_completed(), bool pomo_seconds_event(), uint16_t pomo_user_data(uint8_t index), void pomo_load_user_data(), void pomo_apply_rollover(uint16_t data[5], uint16_t year, uint8_t month, uint8_t day, uint8_t day_of_week), uint8_t pomo_calc_weekday(int year, int month, int day), const int8_t* pomo_display_digits(), bool pomo_display_dot(), const char* pomo_display_text().", "embedding": [-0.055633544921875, 0.02337646484375, -0.0197601318359375, -0.031463623046875, -0.026336669921875, 0.0066070556640625, 0.025360107421875, -0.006839752197265625, 0.0215911865234375, -0.0222320556640625, 0.0090484619140625, -0.029541015625, -0.039459228515625, 0.015655517578125, 0.03692626953125, 0.0228118896484375, -0.011